[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3485050302","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106308#issuecomment-3485050302","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106308","id":3485050302,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7PuaW-","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-04T10:06:16Z","updated_at":"2025-11-04T10:06:16Z","body":"What use case does this help with? Where is the proposal? If it's niche, I don't think this needs to be in the engine.\r\n\r\nWhen I think about skipping bytes during parsing of a binary blob file, it is usually because I need to jump to some fixed position, such as a pre-indicated position specified by the file or format, and/or a position rounded to the next multiple of some number, such as a multiple of 4 bytes or 16 bytes. In both cases `seek` would be the appropriate solution.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3485050302/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3485141294","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106308#issuecomment-3485141294","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106308","id":3485141294,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Puwku","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-04T10:24:01Z","updated_at":"2025-11-04T10:24:01Z","body":"I think it's a reasonable request to add this, as it's an operation found in other APIs as well.\r\n\r\nBut we generally avoid adding new APIs unless the problem is common or hard. See also [Best practices for engine contributors](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/best_practices.html#the-problem-has-to-be-complex-or-frequent). Since the problem is easy to work around, it needs to be common.\r\n\r\nTo gauge whether it is common, I recommend [opening a proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues). If enough people upvote it, that would be an indicator that people run into this, and the function should be added.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3485141294/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]